# Phase 4: Integration and Pipeline Rewire

## Overview
Wire all 3 layers together into a single pipeline flow. Modify V16 SKILL.md to insert new steps. Create orchestration script that runs full empire pipeline end-to-end.

## Requirements
- Functional: Single command runs full pipeline (signal → filter → staircase → verdict)
- Non-functional: Backward compatible — V16 still works standalone if empire layer disabled

## Architecture

```
/hunt (new empire mode)
  ↓
Layer 1: pain-signal-miner + platform-shift-detector + V16 archetype scanners
  ↓
founder-edge-matcher (filter by founder profile)
  ↓
Layer 2: compound-filter (5-year test) + timing-scorer
  ↓
V16 deep-reasoner (existing, unchanged)
  ↓
Layer 3: staircase-enforcer (block if below stair)
  ↓
Empire Verdict: GO_EMPIRE / GO_BRIDGE / KILL
  ↓
compound-dashboard update
```

## Related Code Files

**Create (in master_investments):**
- `.claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/empire-pipeline-runner.py` — orchestrator

**Modify (in master_investments):**
